# This repo's production backend runs on Railway (primary) and Google
# Cloud Run (fallback) as a real Node/Express server (server.ts +
# Dockerfile) fronted by Cloudflare Pages -- see DEPLOYMENT.md. It is not
# deployed as Vercel Serverless Functions.
#
# Vercel auto-detects any file under api/ as a candidate Serverless
# Function and type-checks/bundles it individually. Several files under
# api/ (notably api/gateway-legacy.ts, still imported by api/gateway.ts,
# and api/twilio/service.ts) predate that convention and fail Vercel's
# per-function TypeScript check, which fails the whole deployment even
# though `npm run build` (the real frontend build) succeeds on its own.
#
# Excluding api/ here stops Vercel from trying to package those files as
# functions at all. Ad hoc Vercel deployments of this repo serve the
# static frontend only -- /api/* routes are not expected to work there.
api
